  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0000" ref="bni_9ky_npc">蕭寶夤</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0005" ref="bni_9ky_npc">智亮</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0008" ref="w4m_9tw_147">蕭鸞</persName>第六子，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0014" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">寶卷</persName>母弟也。<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0020" ref="w4m_9tw_147">鸞</persName>之竊位，封<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0026" ref="bni_9ky_npc">寶夤</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-059-wangzhan-royal-context:line037:m0028" ref="bni_9ky_npc">建安王</persName>。</p>
